{
  "thig14.1:0.1": "",
  "thig14.1:0.2": "14. Tiṃsanipāto ",
  "thig14.1:0.3": "1. Subhājīvakambavanikātherīgāthā 368. ",
  "thig14.1:1.1": "Jīvakambavanaṃ rammaṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:1.2": "gacchantiṃ bhikkhuniṃ subhaṃ; ",
  "thig14.1:1.3": "Dhuttako sannivāresi , ",
  "thig14.1:1.4": "tamenaṃ abravī subhā. ",
  "thig14.1:2.1": "369. ‘‘Kiṃ te aparādhitaṃ mayā, ",
  "thig14.1:2.2": "yaṃ maṃ ovariyāna tiṭṭhasi; ",
  "thig14.1:2.3": "Na hi pabbajitāya āvuso, ",
  "thig14.1:2.4": "puriso samphusanāya kappati. ",
  "thig14.1:3.1": "370. ‘‘Garuke mama satthusāsane, ",
  "thig14.1:3.2": "yā sikkhā sugatena desitā; ",
  "thig14.1:3.3": "Parisuddhapadaṃ anaṅgaṇaṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:3.4": "kiṃ maṃ ovariyāna tiṭṭhasi. ",
  "thig14.1:4.1": "371. ‘‘Āvilacitto anāvilaṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:4.2": "sarajo vītarajaṃ anaṅgaṇaṃ; ",
  "thig14.1:4.3": "Sabbattha vimuttamānasaṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:4.4": "kiṃ maṃ ovariyāna tiṭṭhasi’’. ",
  "thig14.1:5.1": "372. ‘‘Daharā ca apāpikā casi, ",
  "thig14.1:5.2": "kiṃ te pabbajjā karissati; ",
  "thig14.1:5.3": "Nikkhipa kāsāyacīvaraṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:5.4": "ehi ramāma supupphite vane. ",
  "thig14.1:6.1": "373. ‘‘Madhurañca pavanti sabbaso, ",
  "thig14.1:6.2": "kusumarajena samuṭṭhitā dumā; ",
  "thig14.1:6.3": "Paṭhamavasanto sukho utu, ",
  "thig14.1:6.4": "ehi ramāma supupphite vane. ",
  "thig14.1:7.1": "374. ‘‘Kusumitasikharā ca pādapā, ",
  "thig14.1:7.2": "abhigajjantiva māluteritā; ",
  "thig14.1:7.3": "Kā tuyhaṃ rati bhavissati, ",
  "thig14.1:7.4": "yadi ekā vanamogahissasi . ",
  "thig14.1:8.1": "375. ‘‘Vāḷamigasaṅghasevitaṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:8.2": "kuñjaramattakareṇuloḷitaṃ; ",
  "thig14.1:8.3": "Asahāyikā gantumicchasi, ",
  "thig14.1:8.4": "rahitaṃ bhiṃsanakaṃ mahāvanaṃ. ",
  "thig14.1:9.1": "376. ‘‘Tapanīyakatāva dhītikā, ",
  "thig14.1:9.2": "vicarasi cittalateva accharā; ",
  "thig14.1:9.3": "Kāsikasukhumehi vaggubhi, ",
  "thig14.1:9.4": "sobhasī suvasanehi nūpame. ",
  "thig14.1:10.1": "377. ‘‘Ahaṃ tava vasānugo siyaṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:10.2": "yadi viharemase kānanantare; ",
  "thig14.1:10.3": "Na hi matthi tayā piyattaro, ",
  "thig14.1:10.4": "pāṇo kinnarimandalocane. ",
  "thig14.1:11.1": "378. ‘‘Yadi me vacanaṃ karissasi, ",
  "thig14.1:11.2": "sukhitā ehi agāramāvasa; ",
  "thig14.1:11.3": "Pāsādanivātavāsinī, ",
  "thig14.1:11.4": "parikammaṃ te karontu nāriyo. ",
  "thig14.1:12.1": "379. ‘‘Kāsikasukhumāni dhāraya, ",
  "thig14.1:12.2": "abhiropehi ca mālavaṇṇakaṃ; ",
  "thig14.1:12.3": "Kañcanamaṇimuttakaṃ bahuṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:12.4": "vividhaṃ ābharaṇaṃ karomi te. ",
  "thig14.1:13.1": "380. ‘‘Sudhotarajapacchadaṃ subhaṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:13.2": "goṇakatūlikasanthataṃ navaṃ; ",
  "thig14.1:13.3": "Abhiruha sayanaṃ mahārahaṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:13.4": "candanamaṇḍitasāragandhikaṃ; ",
  "thig14.1:14.1": "381. ‘‘Uppalaṃ cudakā samuggataṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:14.2": "yathā taṃ amanussasevitaṃ; ",
  "thig14.1:14.3": "Evaṃ tvaṃ brahmacārinī, ",
  "thig14.1:14.4": "sakesaṅgesu jaraṃ gamissasi’’. ",
  "thig14.1:15.1": "382. ‘‘Kiṃ te idha sārasammataṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:15.2": "kuṇapapūramhi susānavaḍḍhane; ",
  "thig14.1:15.3": "Bhedanadhamme kaḷevare , ",
  "thig14.1:15.4": "yaṃ disvā vimano udikkhasi’’. ",
  "thig14.1:16.1": "383. ‘‘Akkhīni ca turiyāriva, ",
  "thig14.1:16.2": "kinnariyāriva pabbatantare; ",
  "thig14.1:16.3": "Tava me nayanāni dakkhiya, ",
  "thig14.1:16.4": "bhiyyo kāmaratī pavaḍḍhati. ",
  "thig14.1:17.1": "384. ‘‘Uppalasikharopamāni te, ",
  "thig14.1:17.2": "vimale hāṭakasannibhe mukhe; ",
  "thig14.1:17.3": "Tava me nayanāni dakkhiya , ",
  "thig14.1:17.4": "bhiyyo kāmaguṇo pavaḍḍhati. ",
  "thig14.1:18.1": "385. ‘‘Api dūragatā saramhase, ",
  "thig14.1:18.2": "āyatapamhe visuddhadassane; ",
  "thig14.1:18.3": "Na hi matthi tayā piyattarā, ",
  "thig14.1:18.4": "nayanā kinnarimandalocane’’. ",
  "thig14.1:19.1": "386. ‘‘Apathena payātumicchasi, ",
  "thig14.1:19.2": "candaṃ kīḷanakaṃ gavesasi; ",
  "thig14.1:19.3": "Meruṃ laṅghetumicchasi, ",
  "thig14.1:19.4": "yo tvaṃ buddhasutaṃ maggayasi. ",
  "thig14.1:20.1": "387. ‘‘Natthi hi loke sadevake, ",
  "thig14.1:20.2": "rāgo yatthapi dāni me siyā; ",
  "thig14.1:20.3": "Napi naṃ jānāmi kīriso, ",
  "thig14.1:20.4": "atha maggena hato samūlako. ",
  "thig14.1:21.1": "388. ‘‘Iṅgālakuyāva ujjhito, ",
  "thig14.1:21.2": "visapattoriva aggito kato ; ",
  "thig14.1:21.3": "Napi naṃ passāmi kīriso, ",
  "thig14.1:21.4": "atha maggena hato samūlako. ",
  "thig14.1:22.1": "389. ‘‘Yassā siyā apaccavekkhitaṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:22.2": "satthā vā anupāsito siyā; ",
  "thig14.1:22.3": "Tvaṃ tādisikaṃ palobhaya, ",
  "thig14.1:22.4": "jānantiṃ so imaṃ vihaññasi. ",
  "thig14.1:23.1": "390. ‘‘Mayhañhi akkuṭṭhavandite, ",
  "thig14.1:23.2": "sukhadukkhe ca satī upaṭṭhitā; ",
  "thig14.1:23.3": "Saṅkhatamasubhanti jāniya, ",
  "thig14.1:23.4": "sabbattheva mano na limpati. ",
  "thig14.1:24.1": "391. ‘‘Sāhaṃ sugatassa sāvikā, ",
  "thig14.1:24.2": "maggaṭṭhaṅgikayānayāyinī; ",
  "thig14.1:24.3": "Uddhaṭasallā anāsavā, ",
  "thig14.1:24.4": "suññāgāragatā ramāmahaṃ. ",
  "thig14.1:25.1": "392. ‘‘Diṭṭhā hi mayā sucittitā, ",
  "thig14.1:25.2": "sombhā dārukapillakāni vā; ",
  "thig14.1:25.3": "Tantīhi ca khīlakehi ca, ",
  "thig14.1:25.4": "vinibaddhā vividhaṃ panaccakā. ",
  "thig14.1:26.1": "393. ‘‘Tamhuddhaṭe tantikhīlake, ",
  "thig14.1:26.2": "vissaṭṭhe vikale parikrite ; ",
  "thig14.1:26.3": "Na vindeyya khaṇḍaso kate, ",
  "thig14.1:26.4": "kimhi tattha manaṃ nivesaye. ",
  "thig14.1:27.1": "394. ‘‘Tathūpamā dehakāni maṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:27.2": "tehi dhammehi vinā na vattanti; ",
  "thig14.1:27.3": "Dhammehi vinā na vattati, ",
  "thig14.1:27.4": "kimhi tattha manaṃ nivesaye. ",
  "thig14.1:28.1": "395. ‘‘Yathā haritālena makkhitaṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:28.2": "addasa cittikaṃ bhittiyā kataṃ; ",
  "thig14.1:28.3": "Tamhi te viparītadassanaṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:28.4": "saññā mānusikā niratthikā. ",
  "thig14.1:29.1": "396. ‘‘Māyaṃ viya aggato kataṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:29.2": "supinanteva suvaṇṇapādapaṃ; ",
  "thig14.1:29.3": "Upagacchasi andha rittakaṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:29.4": "janamajjheriva rupparūpakaṃ . ",
  "thig14.1:30.1": "397. ‘‘Vaṭṭaniriva koṭarohitā, ",
  "thig14.1:30.2": "majjhe pubbuḷakā saassukā; ",
  "thig14.1:30.3": "Pīḷakoḷikā cettha jāyati, ",
  "thig14.1:30.4": "vividhā cakkhuvidhā ca piṇḍitā’’. ",
  "thig14.1:31.1": "398. Uppāṭiya cārudassanā, ",
  "thig14.1:31.2": "na ca pajjittha asaṅgamānasā; ",
  "thig14.1:31.3": "‘‘Handa te cakkhuṃ harassu taṃ’’, ",
  "thig14.1:31.4": "tassa narassa adāsi tāvade. ",
  "thig14.1:32.1": "399. Tassa ca viramāsi tāvade, ",
  "thig14.1:32.2": "rāgo tattha khamāpayī ca naṃ; ",
  "thig14.1:32.3": "‘‘Sotthi siyā brahmacārinī, ",
  "thig14.1:32.4": "na puno edisakaṃ bhavissati’’. ",
  "thig14.1:33.1": "400. ‘‘Āsādiya edisaṃ janaṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:33.2": "aggiṃ pajjalitaṃ va liṅgiya; ",
  "thig14.1:33.3": "Gaṇhiya āsīvisaṃ viya, ",
  "thig14.1:33.4": "api nu sotthi siyā khamehi no’’. ",
  "thig14.1:34.1": "401. Muttā ca tato sā bhikkhunī, ",
  "thig14.1:34.2": "agamī buddhavarassa santikaṃ; ",
  "thig14.1:34.3": "Passiya varapuññalakkhaṇaṃ, ",
  "thig14.1:34.4": "cakkhu āsi yathā purāṇakanti. … ",
  "thig14.1:35.1": "Subhā jīvakambavanikā therī…. ",
  "thig14.1:36.1": "Tiṃsanipāto niṭṭhito. "
}
